[00:12.80]In preaching the Kingdom and teaching the truth,
[00:18.82]Our Lord showed us how to proceed:
[00:25.12]‘Search out those deserving and ready to hear,
[00:30.78]Those aware of their spiritual need.
[00:37.30]By greeting the household and wishing it peace,
[00:42.88]Then it may be that peace you’ll impart.
[00:49.74]But when they refuse you or turn you away,
[00:55.36]Shake the dust from your feet and depart.’
[01:02.34]All those who receive you receive him as well,
[01:11.15]Respond when their heart opens wide.
[01:17.44]Their right disposition for unending life
[01:23.20]Will impel them to serve at your side.
[01:29.76]And never be anxious about what to say,
[01:35.36]For Jehovah will help you to speak.
[01:42.34]Your answer when gracious and seasoned with salt
[01:48.38]Will appeal to the humble and meek.
